# IZITHRIFT — COMPLETE MARKETPLACE UI/UX REDESIGN & FEATURE IMPLEMENTATION

## PROJECT CONTEXT

You are working directly on the existing source code of **izithrift (Retro Market)**, a secondhand C2C marketplace application.

This project is an existing university mobile application/demo. The codebase already contains many screens, features, routes, backend integrations, UI components, product models, auction functionality, authentication, seller functionality, and payment flows.

Your task is to inspect the existing source and implement a comprehensive UI/UX upgrade while preserving all existing functional capabilities.

This is NOT a request to create a new app from scratch.

This is NOT a request to generate static mockup screens.

I want the actual existing application to be improved, with working navigation, interactions, screens, and demo flows.

You may inspect, refactor, implement, and test the existing source code directly.

